I'm not having a lot of time to play lately (as I'm at work) so I
figured I'd list some of the things I think the developers could
consider adding to Nethack. I hope you guys find it interesting:

1. Chicatrice soccer
Kicking small monsters make them go back and hit other monster, walls
or fall into the water/lava. Also good to avoid small annoying
monsters.

2. More attack effects
Kicks should also knock bigger monsters, hitting someone in with a
club should cause stunning (ever got hit in the head by one?), big
time attacks against smaller monsters should break their weapons, stun
and confuse them more often.

3. Monsters brawl
Why monsters never get angry at each other? Dogs and cats and elfs and
orcs, for example, should fight all the time too.

4. Lucky shot
When you trow luck stones, they never miss the target. Makes sense,
doesn't it?

5. Alchemy is cool, need some more
There should be a way to create explosive potions by mixing. Imagine
trowing potions that explode!

6. A monsters class
Why can't we play as troll, werewolf, mind flyier and others?

7. Poisoned weapons
Any bladed weapon can be poisoned by dipping into a potion of sickness
for a short period, much like when you read a confuse monster scroll.
Poisoned daggers anyone?

8. Monsters shouldn't see the traps you see
I might be wrong, but every time you spot a trap, all monsters seem to
notice it as well and don't fall in it.

9. Silver short swords
Otherwise, why bother ever getting experient at it?

10. Cellphone and Mail demon fun
I can think of cool thing to do with the mail demon, why not have a
cell phone where you can order stuff such as pizza and have it
delivered to you on the floor that you choose by a mail demon after a
while? If you don't pay, he'd get very angry. Another use for the
cellphone would be to hire protection from demons.

11. Way too much money!
There must be a way to take advantage of getting so much money near
the end. Maybe there could be a store were you can pre-order
incredible expensive artifacts via catalog that will be delivered to
you by mail demon after some time.



